track cancerMutations
shortLabel Cancer Mutations
longLabel Somatic mutations in cancer
superTrack on
group phenDis

track cancerHotspots
parent cancerMutations pack
shortLabel Cancer Hotspots
longLabel Cancer Hotspots (cancerhotspots.org): amino acids that are mutated in cancer more often than expected by chance
type bigBed 12 +
bigDataUrl /gbdb/$D/cancerMutations/cancerHotspots.bb
itemRgb on
visibility pack
priority 3
mouseOver <b>${name}</b> ${hotspotType}, ${version}<br>${tumors} tumors, q-value ${qValue}<br>${topTissues}
skipFields score,strand,thickStart,thickEnd,reserved,blockCount,blockSizes,chromStarts,tissues,topTissues
skipEmptyFields on
urls transcript="https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Transcript/Summary?t=$$"
filterByRange.tumors on
filter.tumors 1:2175
filterValues.hotspotType single residue,in-frame indel,splice site
filterLabel.hotspotType Hotspot type
filterValues.version v2 (Chang et al. 2017),v3 (Bandlamudi et al. 2026)
filterLabel.version Hotspot release
filterValues.oncoKb yes,no
filterLabel.oncoKb In OncoKB
filterValues.tissues Lung,Bowel,Esophagus/Stomach,Uterus,Breast,Bladder,CNS/Brain,Skin,Head and neck,Prostate,Pancreas,Unknown,Kidney,Ovary/Fallopian tube,Soft tissue,Lymphoid,Liver,Blood,Biliary tract,Cervix,Thyroid,Testis,Adrenal gland,Bone,Ampulla of Vater,Thymus,Eye,Vulva/Vagina,Penis,Pleura,Peritoneum
filterType.tissues multipleListOr
filterLabel.tissues Cancer tissue

track intogen
parent cancerMutations pack
shortLabel IntOGen Drivers
longLabel IntOGen: mutational cancer driver genes found in 271 tumor cohorts
type bigBed 12 +
bigDataUrl /gbdb/$D/cancerMutations/intogen.bb
itemRgb on
visibility pack
priority 3.5
mouseOver <b>${name}</b>: ${role}<br>Driver in ${cohortCount} cohorts, ${cancerTypeCount} cancer types<br>${topTypes}
skipFields name,score,strand,thickStart,thickEnd,reserved,blockCount,blockSizes,chromStarts,cancerTypes
detailsDynamicTable _jsonCohorts|Cohorts where the gene is a driver,_jsonRegions|Protein regions with significant mutation clusters
urls transcript="https://www.ensembl.org/Homo_sapiens/Transcript/Summary?t=$$" gene="https://www.intogen.org/search?gene=$$"
filterValues.role Activating,Loss of function,Ambiguous
filterLabel.role Mode of action
filterByRange.cohortCount on
filter.cohortCount 1:212
filterLabel.cohortCount Number of cohorts
filterByRange.maxPct on
filter.maxPct 0:100
filterLabel.maxPct Highest % of mutated tumors in a cohort
filterValues.cancerTypes Invasive Breast Carcinoma,Hepatocellular Carcinoma,Prostate Adenocarcinoma,Bladder Urothelial Carcinoma,Diffuse Large B-Cell Lymphoma NOS,Melanoma,Colorectal Adenocarcinoma,Lung Adenocarcinoma,Lung Squamous Cell Carcinoma,Stomach Adenocarcinoma,Esophageal Adenocarcinoma,Head and Neck Squamous Cell Carcinoma,Acute Myeloid Leukemia,Endometrial Carcinoma,Pancreatic Adenocarcinoma,Cholangiocarcinoma,Malignant Lymphoma,Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma,Ovarian Epithelial Tumor,Plasma Cell Myeloma,Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia/Small Lymphocytic Lymphoma,Medulloblastoma,Glioblastoma Multiforme,Renal Clear Cell Carcinoma,Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer,Colon Adenocarcinoma,Low-Grade Glioma NOS,Pilocytic Astrocytoma,Well-Differentiated Thyroid Cancer,Cervical Squamous Cell Carcinoma,Pleural Mesothelioma,Nasopharyngeal Carcinoma,Basal Cell Carcinoma,Acute Lymphoblastic Leukemia,Cutaneous Melanoma,Papillary Renal Cell Carcinoma,Prostate,Pancreas,Neuroblastoma,Angiosarcoma,Small Cell Lung Cancer,Burkitt Lymphoma,Uterine Carcinosarcoma/Uterine Malignant Mixed Mullerian Tumor,Renal Cell Carcinoma,Cutaneous Squamous Cell Carcinoma,Esophageal Squamous Cell Carcinoma,Upper Tract Urothelial Carcinoma,Cervical Adenocarcinoma,Esophagus/Stomach,High-Grade Glioma NOS,Adrenocortical Carcinoma,Glioblastoma,Leiomyosarcoma,Rectal Adenocarcinoma,Salivary Carcinoma,Anal Squamous Cell Carcinoma,Osteosarcoma,Bladder/Urinary Tract,Soft Tissue,Thymoma,Vulva/Vagina,Adenoid Cystic Carcinoma,Malignant Tumor,Chromophobe Renal Cell Carcinoma,Esophagogastric Adenocarcinoma,Paraganglioma,Small Intestinal Carcinoma,Gallbladder Cancer,Mixed Germ Cell Tumor,Pancreatic Neuroendocrine Tumor,Skin,Uveal Melanoma,Gastrointestinal Stromal Tumor,Neuroendocrine Tumor NOS,Lung,Wilms Tumor,Ewing Sarcoma,Liposarcoma,Lymphoid Neoplasm,Sarcoma NOS,Myelodysplastic Syndromes,Rhabdomyosarcoma,Atypical Teratoid/Rhabdoid Tumor,Ependymoma,Hepatoblastoma,Retinoblastoma
filterType.cancerTypes multipleListOr
filterLabel.cancerTypes Cancer type
